- (capability) `matrix#v040-04` — each of the five debts reached the founder as a fork (inputs#I2, through
  `founder-forks.md`). The four fixed are proven headless in both layout modes, each by its named check:
  - F1 by `stand_lint`'s and `select_popup_painted`'s new tests;
  - F2 by `select_popup`'s row-height test and `select_popup_painted`'s unclipped glyph;
  - F3 by `select_popup`'s tree and marks tests and `stand_act_popup`'s press;
  - F5 by `stand_cells_served`'s new test.

  F4 stands kept as the residual `res-ysz67imk`, with his reason (its own route entry, inputs#I2): implement's report
  enumerates the five forks and their dispositions. Every check is green in the integration entries above.
